  "updated_at": "2026-03-01",
  "bio": "Carlo Coletti is a distinguished tattoo artist specializing in the neotraditional style, based in Hamm, Germany, at the sharp and stylish 37Grad Tattoo Manufaktur. Known for maintaining an exceptionally clean and hygienic workspace, Carlo ensures each client's safety and peace of mind, making the tattoo experience both comfortable and reassuring. With a dedication to cleanliness that matches his artistic prowess, clients can expect a top-notch experience with beautiful results."
}